---
import { wedding } from '../data/wedding';
import Divider from './Divider.astro';
---

<section class="section" id="regalos" aria-labelledby="regalos-title">
	<Divider />
	<h2 class="section-title" id="regalos-title">Regalos</h2>
	<div class="gift-box">
		<p class="lede tight">{wedding.gifts.intro}</p>
		<p>Si igual quieren dejar un detalle, acá va nuestro alias y el CBU.</p>
		<div class="copy-row">
			<div class="copy-item">
				<code data-copy-value>{wedding.gifts.alias}</code>
				<button type="button" data-copy>Copiar alias</button>
			</div>
			<div class="copy-item">
				<code data-copy-value>{wedding.gifts.cbu}</code>
				<button type="button" data-copy>Copiar CBU</button>
			</div>
		</div>
		<p class="holder">Titular: {wedding.gifts.holder}. {wedding.gifts.cbuHint}</p>
	</div>
</section>
